---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout pageId="leadership">
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container page-hero__grid">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Officers and vacancies</span><h1>Current officers and open positions.</h1><p class="page-hero__lead">See who is serving, which positions are vacant, and what each role is responsible for.</p><div class="page-hero__actions"><a class="button button--primary" href="join?interest=leadership">Ask about an open role</a><a class="button button--secondary" href="#roles">View open positions</a></div></div>
    <div class="page-hero__side"><figure class="page-hero__figure"><img src="assets/images/photos/soldering-workshop.jpg" width="1200" height="960" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" alt="Hands soldering a wire onto a small circuit board"></figure><aside class="page-hero__aside"><strong>Interested in an open role?</strong><p>Select leadership on the membership form. The group will contact you to discuss the responsibilities and expected time.</p></aside></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="roles">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Current roster</span><h2>Officers and open positions.</h2></div><p>Each vacant position lists its expected responsibilities.</p></div>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--2" data-leader-grid aria-live="polite"><div class="empty-state"><h3>Loading officers and open positions…</h3><p>Please wait a moment.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Officer work</span><h2>Basic commitments.</h2></div><p>Officers attend planning meetings, complete agreed tasks, and keep shared records current.</p></div>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--4">
      <article class="card"><h3>Meetings</h3><p>Read the agenda and bring any required decisions or updates.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h3>Shared records</h3><p>Store contacts, budgets, files, and project notes where the next officer can find them.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h3>Accurate information</h3><p>Label unconfirmed events, roles, and plans clearly.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h3>Accessible participation</h3><p>Consider scheduling, cost, disability access, and required experience when planning activities.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container split">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">First-year students</span><h2>Ask about any open role.</h2><p>Before an officer is selected, the group will discuss the responsibilities, expected time, and experience the position requires.</p></div>
    <div class="callout callout--plain"><h3>Participate without holding office</h3><p>General members can join projects or help with events, photography, design, and records after those activities are confirmed.</p><a class="text-link" href="join">View membership options →</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
